===============================================================================
Tribute & Clean-Room Provenance Notice:
===============================================================================
PrismX is named in tribute to Dave Cutler's historic 1988 DEC PRISM RISC
architecture and the foundational Windows NT graphics executive. 

All interfaces, structures, and software pipelines in this repository have been
clean-room engineered in modern ISO C++23 strictly against publicly available,
openly licensed specifications:
  - Microsoft DirectX-Headers (MIT License): https://github.com/microsoft/DirectX-Headers
  - Microsoft Win32 Metadata (MIT License): https://github.com/microsoft/win32metadata
  - Khronos Vulkan 1.3 Specification (Apache 2.0 / MIT)

DirectX, Direct3D, and DXGI are registered trademarks of Microsoft Corporation.
Vulkan is a registered trademark of the Khronos Group Inc.
Nominative use of these marks is solely for interoperability and architectural
compatibility under fair use principles.
